{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00351",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 7.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.07,
      "end_seconds": 10.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.8,
      "end_seconds": 16.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.88,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Right, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.12,
      "end_seconds": 26.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I wanted to get pain in my right shoulder looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.38,
      "end_seconds": 31.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.98,
      "end_seconds": 38.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "For two days, I'd say. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.98,
      "end_seconds": 42.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Go on. Is it constant, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.97,
      "end_seconds": 45.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.36,
      "end_seconds": 47.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Anything that helps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.68,
      "end_seconds": 51.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Only rest, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.97,
      "end_seconds": 56.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 56.91,
      "end_seconds": 62.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.6,
      "end_seconds": 65.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.33,
      "end_seconds": 71.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "I've also had a click in the shoulder, for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.32,
      "end_seconds": 78.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Have you had pain in your right shoulder before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.98,
      "end_seconds": 85.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.5,
      "end_seconds": 89.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.69,
      "end_seconds": 90.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.6,
      "end_seconds": 101.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Has there been any neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.75,
      "end_seconds": 104.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No. No neck pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.04,
      "end_seconds": 108.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "So, any chest pain, fever or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.09,
      "end_seconds": 120.61,
      "duration_seconds": 11.52,
      "text": "No, no chest pain, no fever, no fall. I did have a dull ache down the arm at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.59,
      "end_seconds": 124.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.28,
      "end_seconds": 127.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.87,
      "end_seconds": 132.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.81,
      "end_seconds": 133.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.58,
      "end_seconds": 143.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 143.81,
      "end_seconds": 149.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse 83, saturation 98 percent, pressure 114 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.13,
      "end_seconds": 157.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Thanks. Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.02,
      "end_seconds": 167.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. I've got high blood pressure. An underactive thyroid, for two years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.1,
      "end_seconds": 170.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.19,
      "end_seconds": 185.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "text": "Okay, diabetes, that's already on your record. Good to know. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Any allergies I should know about? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.87,
      "end_seconds": 194.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Well, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.19,
      "end_seconds": 207.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.22,
      "end_seconds": 209.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.69,
      "end_seconds": 214.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.23,
      "end_seconds": 220.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "My father had a stroke. My uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.69,
      "end_seconds": 223.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.03,
      "end_seconds": 227.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.33,
      "end_seconds": 229.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.74,
      "end_seconds": 234.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.64,
      "end_seconds": 238.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.08,
      "end_seconds": 239.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.09,
      "end_seconds": 259.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What medicines do you take regularly? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.64,
      "end_seconds": 262.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 263.15,
      "end_seconds": 270.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Well, doctor, I think the last prescription for the glimepiride was 4 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.28,
      "end_seconds": 277.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.96,
      "end_seconds": 293.89,
      "duration_seconds": 15.93,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. Volini gel. I take it twice a day. I'd been on losartan, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.27,
      "end_seconds": 299.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.19,
      "end_seconds": 300.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.46,
      "end_seconds": 318.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.17,
      "end_seconds": 321.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.29,
      "end_seconds": 324.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.89,
      "end_seconds": 358.38,
      "duration_seconds": 19.49,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. So, based on your history, this looks most like a rotator cuff problem. It could also be frozen shoulder, so we'll keep that open. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your right shoulder for two days, and no chest pain or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.82,
      "end_seconds": 361.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.82,
      "end_seconds": 377.1,
      "duration_seconds": 15.28,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.36,
      "end_seconds": 380.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.05,
      "end_seconds": 389.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ultrasound of the shoulder, for shoulder pain. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.7,
      "end_seconds": 391.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.17,
      "end_seconds": 415.33,
      "duration_seconds": 22.16,
      "text": "We should do an X-ray of the shoulder for shoulder pain. Let's use paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. That's for shoulder pain. Gentle pendulum exercises, I'll show you a couple, but nothing overhead for a bit. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. We'll refer you to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.99,
      "end_seconds": 417.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.19,
      "end_seconds": 425.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.53,
      "end_seconds": 427.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 429.09,
      "end_seconds": 434.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.05,
      "end_seconds": 436.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.14,
      "end_seconds": 442.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.99,
      "end_seconds": 447.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.8,
      "end_seconds": 453.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.68,
      "end_seconds": 462.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 463.19,
      "end_seconds": 468.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 470.09,
      "end_seconds": 473.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 474.33,
      "end_seconds": 476.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}